'''Mythic Bosses''' are the Enemy counterparts of [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]] that can be encountered in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]], [[Legend Stages]], [[Heavenly Tower]], and [[Infernal Tower]]. Mythic Bosses are very similar to [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Bosses]] in terms of design, stage dynamics, and stats, although early on they tend to be much more reliant on support. They also tend to drop themselves from their stages, or unlock their [[True Form]].

Certain Mythic Bosses are encountered multiple times, usually as a [[List of Enemy Variants|Variant]] of themselves for the Main Chapter and Tower bosses, or more commonly among the Legend Stage bosses, with different magnifications or support.

